<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="33db1350">&lt;p&gt;
    This work product provides a list of current initiatives that are germane to the area of study. An inventory of current
    initiatives will help understand and identify complementary initiatives. It can also be used during workshops
    with stakeholders to review and rationalize the on-going initiatives, understand if they are duplicative to the
    project and combine and / or place on hold existing initiatives.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
